## Power BI Visual Guide (Day 07,08 & 09)
Tools: Power BI Desktop  
Datasets: SampleSuperstore.xlsx, IndiaPopulation.xlsx

📅 Dates: 10-12 July 2025  
- Over the course of Day 07 and Day 08, multiple chart types were explored—from simple bar charts to advanced 
  visuals like Gauge, Ribbon, Waterfall, Tree Maps, and Line & Column charts.  
- On Day 09 multiple Power BI visuals including Cards, Pie Charts, Bar Charts, Gauge Charts, Tables, and Slicers using a sales dataset. 
- Final dashboard combines all visuals with DAX-based yearly sales measures.
 

 


